.TH LIBRECELIK 1 "2026" "LibreCelik 5.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
LibreCelik \- read and sign with LibreSCRS smart cards
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B LibreCelik
.RB [ \-\-version ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B LibreCelik
reads Serbian government smart cards (identity, vehicle and health), ICAO
electronic travel documents, NIST PIV cards and PKCS#15 cards, and signs
documents in PAdES, XAdES and CAdES.
.PP
It talks to the card through the LibreSCRS agent
.RB ( librescrs\-agent ),
which owns the card session and collects the PIN in its own prompter.
Without the agent installed and running, LibreCelik starts and says so.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version and exit, without opening a window.
.SH SEE ALSO
.UR https://librescrs.github.io/
.UE
